{"4116640":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Console War Giant : A Turn-Based Tycoon","steam_appid":4116640,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Console War Giant<\/strong> is a management game that puts you in charge of a young company producing video game consoles! The gaming industry is still in its infancy. A place under the sun is yours to claim!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own consoles, secure your hardware supply, build your game catalog, and target your markets wisely. But beware! Your competitors won’t go down without a fight!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/506cf7e176906103e90c20efc9dca1bf.poster.avif?t=1793691828\" width=640 height=344 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/506cf7e176906103e90c20efc9dca1bf.webm?t=1793691828\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/506cf7e176906103e90c20efc9dca1bf.mp4?t=1793691828\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax! It’s turn-based<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes we just need a break from games that overwhelm us with constant notifications and events. <strong>Console War Giant<\/strong> is turn-based and divided into several phases, so you’ll have all the time you need to assess the situation and plan your actions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/586c082cb04227ffe5882a46fd496e8d.poster.avif?t=1793691828\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/586c082cb04227ffe5882a46fd496e8d.webm?t=1793691828\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/586c082cb04227ffe5882a46fd496e8d.mp4?t=1793691828\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your own consoles and controllers<\/strong> using a dedicated 3D interface. Then, choose their technical specifications according to your goals.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your console’s game catalog<\/strong> based on the markets you want to target. Support development studios in porting their games. And if you secure some exclusives, even better!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure your essential hardware supply <\/strong>through a competitive auction system. Get the best deals possible!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add features and services<\/strong> such as streaming platforms, virtual stores, or DVD players. Select the ones that best match customer expectations at the time.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Produce and sell accessories and merchandise<\/strong> to maximize your profits!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negotiate the best deals<\/strong> with console retailers to expand your market presence.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the console war!<\/strong> Your rivals will take aggressive actions against you. But you’ll have opportunities to strike back. Your ultimate goal: take them over!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch marketing campaigns<\/strong> at the right moment. Whether to boost immediate sales or drive long-term results.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience key events in gaming history<\/strong> and their consequences, from the 1983 video game crash to the Covid-19 pandemic and much more.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research new technologies<\/strong> to stay ahead of the competition.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfy your Board of Directors,<\/strong> who will regularly assign you new objectives to achieve.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you can see, as the CEO of such a company, you’ll have far more important things to do than arranging isometric offices. :)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/ffb1cb9c687ca9a46d06153d2e99dc74.poster.avif?t=1793691828\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/ffb1cb9c687ca9a46d06153d2e99dc74.webm?t=1793691828\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/ffb1cb9c687ca9a46d06153d2e99dc74.mp4?t=1793691828\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Console War Giant<\/strong> is a management game that puts you in charge of a young company producing video game consoles! The gaming industry is still in its infancy. A place under the sun is yours to claim!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own consoles, secure your hardware supply, build your game catalog, and target your markets wisely. But beware! Your competitors won’t go down without a fight!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/506cf7e176906103e90c20efc9dca1bf.poster.avif?t=1793691828\" width=640 height=344 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/506cf7e176906103e90c20efc9dca1bf.webm?t=1793691828\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/506cf7e176906103e90c20efc9dca1bf.mp4?t=1793691828\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax! It’s turn-based<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes we just need a break from games that overwhelm us with constant notifications and events. <strong>Console War Giant<\/strong> is turn-based and divided into several phases, so you’ll have all the time you need to assess the situation and plan your actions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/586c082cb04227ffe5882a46fd496e8d.poster.avif?t=1793691828\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/586c082cb04227ffe5882a46fd496e8d.webm?t=1793691828\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/586c082cb04227ffe5882a46fd496e8d.mp4?t=1793691828\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your own consoles and controllers<\/strong> using a dedicated 3D interface. Then, choose their technical specifications according to your goals.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your console’s game catalog<\/strong> based on the markets you want to target. Support development studios in porting their games. And if you secure some exclusives, even better!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secure your essential hardware supply <\/strong>through a competitive auction system. Get the best deals possible!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add features and services<\/strong> such as streaming platforms, virtual stores, or DVD players. Select the ones that best match customer expectations at the time.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Produce and sell accessories and merchandise<\/strong> to maximize your profits!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negotiate the best deals<\/strong> with console retailers to expand your market presence.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the console war!<\/strong> Your rivals will take aggressive actions against you. But you’ll have opportunities to strike back. Your ultimate goal: take them over!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch marketing campaigns<\/strong> at the right moment. Whether to boost immediate sales or drive long-term results.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience key events in gaming history<\/strong> and their consequences, from the 1983 video game crash to the Covid-19 pandemic and much more.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research new technologies<\/strong> to stay ahead of the competition.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfy your Board of Directors,<\/strong> who will regularly assign you new objectives to achieve.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you can see, as the CEO of such a company, you’ll have far more important things to do than arranging isometric offices. :)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/ffb1cb9c687ca9a46d06153d2e99dc74.poster.avif?t=1793691828\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/ffb1cb9c687ca9a46d06153d2e99dc74.webm?t=1793691828\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/extras\/ffb1cb9c687ca9a46d06153d2e99dc74.mp4?t=1793691828\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Console War Giant is a turn-based management game that puts you in charge of a young company producing video game consoles! The gaming industry is still in its infancy. A place under the sun is yours to claim!","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Italian, Korean, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Thai, Turkish, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Ukrainian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/6322ff4df3985ff026542e6a30f80b9fcb43ebc9\/header.jpg?t=1793691828","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/b73307d2b9e368185771d120de3eb99d27f7c341\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793691828","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4116640\/b73307d2b9e368185771d120de3eb99d27f7c341\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793691828","website":"https:\/\/consolewargiant.pokandco.eu","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2 GhZ 2 CPU<br><\